The Occident is the collection of countries on the western half of [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]]. The current major ruling powers are [[Geography/Althane/Salores/index|Salores]] on the western coast, [[Geography/Althane/El-Rasar/index|El-Rasar]] on the northern coast, [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]] on the southeastern peninsula, [[Geography/Althane/Brejvasing/index|Brejvasing]] to the south, [[Geography/Althane/Illyara/index|Illyara]] in the center of the [[Geography/Althane/Illyara/The Ghostrime Sea|Ghostrime Sea]], and [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/index|Athrea]] adjacent to the land bridge to the east.

